<title>USA: CluckCorp files for public offering.</title>
<headline>CluckCorp files for public offering.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>CluckCorp International Inc said Wednesday it had filed to offer 500,000 shares of the company's $1 par value Series A redeemable convertible preferred stock at $10 per share.</p>
<p>Proceeds of the offering are to be used primarily for the acquisition of restaurants for sublease to prospective area developers and loans to such area developers.</p>
</text>
